---
layout: layouts/product.njk
title: "VoiceTel Phone — Applications"
description: "VoiceTel Phone applications for web, desktop (Windows / macOS / Linux), and mobile (iOS / Android). SIP-over-TLS, WebRTC media, Bluetooth audio, NAT-friendly."
---
{%- from "partials/v2/macros.njk" import arrow %}
{%- set voicetel = phoneApps.apps | where("key", "voicetel") | first %}
{%- set macDmg = voicetel.desktop | where("platform", "macos") | where("format", ".dmg") | where("arch", "arm64") | first %}
{%- set winSetup = voicetel.desktop | where("platform", "windows") | where("format", "Installer (.exe)") | first %}

<section class="hero hero--page" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
	<div class="hero__bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
	<div class="container hero__inner">
		<div class="hero__copy">
			<p class="eyebrow">VoiceTel Phone &middot; Applications</p>
			<h1 id="hero-heading">Applications.</h1>
			<p class="lede">One app, three form factors &mdash; same crystal-clear calling. Pick the platform you want; all clients use the same VoiceTel SIP credentials.</p>
			<div class="cta-row">
				<a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/signup/">Sign up {{ arrow(14) }}</a>
				<a class="btn btn--secondary btn--lg" href="/phone/applications/web/">Open web phone</a>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="hero__visual">
			{%- set platforms = [
				{ icon: "code-slash", name: "Web", meta: "WebRTC · no install", href: "/phone/applications/web/" },
				{ icon: "hdd-stack", name: "macOS", meta: macDmg.size ~ " · .dmg", href: "/phone/applications/desktop/macos/" },
				{ icon: "hdd-stack", name: "Windows", meta: winSetup.size ~ " · .exe", href: "/phone/applications/desktop/windows/" },
				{ icon: "hdd-stack", name: "Linux", meta: "AppImage · deb · rpm", href: "/phone/applications/desktop/linux/" },
				{ icon: "phone-vibrate", name: "iOS", meta: "App Store", href: "/phone/applications/mobile/ios/" },
				{ icon: "phone-vibrate", name: "Android", meta: "Google Play", href: "/phone/applications/mobile/android/" }
			] %}
			{% include "partials/v2/platform-grid.njk" %}
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint" id="platforms" aria-labelledby="platforms-heading">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="section__head">
			<p class="eyebrow">Pick your platform</p>
			<h2 id="platforms-heading">Web, desktop, or mobile, on the same VoiceTel identity.</h2>
			<p class="lede">Three clients, one set of SIP credentials. Each guide lists what the client does and how to get it.</p>
		</div>
		{%- set features = [
			{ icon: "telephone", title: "Web", body: "Runs entirely in the browser &mdash; no install. HTML, SIP.js, WebRTC. Useful for quick calls and any environment where a desktop or mobile install isn't an option.", href: "/phone/applications/web/", cta: "View web client" },
			{ icon: "layers", title: "Desktop", body: "Native client for Windows, macOS, and Linux using your system audio. Local call recording, signed installers, and the diagnostics surface needed for support escalations.", href: "/phone/applications/desktop/", cta: "View desktop clients" },
			{ icon: "phone-vibrate", title: "Mobile", body: "iPhone and Android clients with background calling, Bluetooth audio routing, and adaptive switching between Wi-Fi and cellular. The same VoiceTel SIP credentials follow you between devices.", href: "/phone/applications/mobile/", cta: "View mobile clients" }
		] %}
		{% include "partials/v2/feature-grid.njk" %}
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--white" id="all-platforms" aria-labelledby="all-platforms-heading">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="row__text">
				<p class="eyebrow">Across all platforms</p>
				<h2 id="all-platforms-heading">The same calling features on every client.</h2>
				<p class="lede">All clients use the same VoiceTel SIP credentials. VoiceML Phone, the same softphone for VoiceML accounts, is available on desktop, the App Store, and Google Play.</p>
				<div class="cta-row">
					<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/voiceml/phone/">VoiceML Phone</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="row__visual">
				{%- set rows = [
					{ title: "Secure SIP over TLS", state: "Included" },
					{ title: "DTMF support", state: "Included" },
					{ title: "Caller ID and privacy controls", state: "Included" },
					{ title: "NAT-friendly configuration", state: "Included" },
					{ title: "Local storage persistence", state: "Included" },
					{ title: "Diagnostics logging", state: "Included" }
				] %}
				{% include "partials/v2/status-card.njk" %}
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="cta-band">
			<div class="cta-band__text">
				<h3 class="cta-band__title">First time setting up?</h3>
				<p class="cta-band__body">Sign up to provision and obtain SIP credentials, then download the client for every platform your team uses.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="cta-band__actions cta-row">
				<a class="btn btn--primary" href="/signup/">Free trial {{ arrow(14) }}</a>
				<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/phone/applications/web/">Open web phone</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
